@startuml finance-adapter-sequence

skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title Sequence Diagram - Finance Adapter: BNPL Approval Integration

actor "Shopping System" as shopping
participant "FinanceController" as ctrl
participant "EnablingClient" as client
participant "WebClient" as webclient
participant "Enabling Finance\nSystem" as enabling

== Happy Path: Finance Approval Granted ==

shopping -> ctrl: POST /api/finance/request\n{customerId, firstName, lastName, phone, amount}
activate ctrl

ctrl -> ctrl: Validate request (@Valid)
note right of ctrl
Validation checks:
- customerId not null
- firstName not blank
- lastName not blank
- phone not blank
- amount positive
end note

ctrl -> client: requestApproval(request)
activate client

client -> client: Log request details\n"Sending finance request for customer {customerId}: £{amount}"

client -> webclient: POST to /api/finance/approve
activate webclient
note right of webclient
WebClient configured with:
- Base URL: http://enabling-mock:8095
- Body: FinanceRequest
- Response type: FinanceResponse
- Blocking call: .block()
end note

webclient -> enabling: POST /api/finance/approve\n{\n  "customerId": {id},\n  "firstName": "{firstName}",\n  "lastName": "{lastName}",\n  "phone": "{phone}",\n  "amount": {amount}\n}
activate enabling

enabling -> enabling: Evaluate credit application\n- Check credit score\n- Assess risk\n- Determine approval

enabling --> webclient: 200 OK\n{\n  "approved": true,\n  "reference": "{approvalRef}",\n  "customerId": {id},\n  "amount": {amount},\n  "reason": "Approved",\n  "timestamp": "{timestamp}"\n}
deactivate enabling

webclient -> webclient: Parse response to FinanceResponse
webclient --> client: FinanceResponse{approved: true}
deactivate webclient

client -> client: Log response\n"Enabling response: APPROVED - {reference}"

client --> ctrl: FinanceResponse
deactivate client

ctrl --> shopping: 200 OK\n{\n  "approved": true,\n  "reference": "{approvalRef}",\n  "customerId": {id},\n  "amount": {amount},\n  "reason": "Approved",\n  "timestamp": "{timestamp}"\n}
deactivate ctrl

== Alternative Path: Finance Approval Denied ==

shopping -> ctrl: POST /api/finance/request\n{customerId, firstName, lastName, phone, amount}
activate ctrl

ctrl -> client: requestApproval(request)
activate client

client -> webclient: POST to /api/finance/approve
activate webclient

webclient -> enabling: POST /api/finance/approve
activate enabling

enabling -> enabling: Evaluate credit application\n- Credit score too low\n- Insufficient income

enabling --> webclient: 200 OK\n{\n  "approved": false,\n  "reference": null,\n  "customerId": {id},\n  "amount": {amount},\n  "reason": "Insufficient credit score",\n  "timestamp": "{timestamp}"\n}
deactivate enabling

webclient --> client: FinanceResponse{approved: false}
deactivate webclient

client -> client: Log response\n"Enabling response: DENIED - null"

client --> ctrl: FinanceResponse
deactivate client

ctrl --> shopping: 200 OK\n{\n  "approved": false,\n  "reference": null,\n  "customerId": {id},\n  "amount": {amount},\n  "reason": "Insufficient credit score",\n  "timestamp": "{timestamp}"\n}
deactivate ctrl

== Error Path: Enabling Finance System Unavailable ==

shopping -> ctrl: POST /api/finance/request\n{customerId, firstName, lastName, phone, amount}
activate ctrl

ctrl -> client: requestApproval(request)
activate client

client -> webclient: POST to /api/finance/approve
activate webclient

webclient -> enabling: POST /api/finance/approve
activate enabling
enabling --> webclient: Connection timeout / 500 Error
deactivate enabling

webclient --> client: throw Exception
deactivate webclient

client -> client: Catch exception\nLog error: "Error calling Enabling API"

client -> client: Build fallback response\nFinanceResponse.builder()\n  .approved(false)\n  .customerId(request.customerId)\n  .amount(request.amount)\n  .reason("Service unavailable")\n  .build()
note right of client
Graceful degradation:
Instead of propagating exception,
return denial response with reason
end note

client --> ctrl: FinanceResponse{approved: false, reason: "Service unavailable"}
deactivate client

ctrl --> shopping: 200 OK\n{\n  "approved": false,\n  "reference": null,\n  "customerId": {id},\n  "amount": {amount},\n  "reason": "Service unavailable",\n  "timestamp": null\n}
deactivate ctrl

== Error Path: Invalid JWT Token ==

shopping -> ctrl: POST /api/finance/request\nAuthorization: Bearer {invalidToken}
activate ctrl

ctrl -> ctrl: JwtAuthenticationFilter intercepts
note right of ctrl
Filter extracts token and validates:
- Parse JWT with shared secret
- Verify signature
- Extract claims
end note

ctrl -> ctrl: Token validation fails
ctrl --> shopping: 401 Unauthorized\n"Invalid or expired token"
deactivate ctrl

@enduml
